</p><p><strong>The Ocean County county clerk records New Jersey deeds and mortgages.</strong></p><h2>Who records deeds in Ocean County</h2><ul><li><a href='https://oceancountyclerk.com/' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>Ocean County Clerk</a> records deeds and mortgages.</li></ul><h2>What we confirmed on the official page</h2><ul><li>Also Ocean County Connection (Ocean County Mall, Toms River) and Southern Service Center, 179 South Main Street, Manahawkin (from the county site listing; confirm with the office)</li><li>eRecord via vendor domain njcountyrecording.com linked from clerk home page (from the county site listing; confirm with the office)</li></ul><h2>Fees</h2><div class=\"chb-cta\" style=\"margin:32px 0;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#0F1C2E 0%,#16293F 100%);padding:28px 32px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;color:#fff;\"><div style=\"max-width:600px;\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px;color:#E0A83C;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:6px;\">Selling in Ocean County?</div><div style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:20px;line-height:1.35;color:#fff;\">We buy Ocean County houses as-is, with no commission, no repairs and no closing costs to you.</div></div><a href=\"#\" onclick=\"var f=document.querySelector('iframe[data-form-id]');if(f){f.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});return false;}\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;padding:14px 24px;border-radius:8px;background:#E0A83C;color:#16203A;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;\">Get My Cash Offer &rarr;</a></div><h2>What we could not confirm</h2><ul><li>Millage/tax rates not researched</li></ul><h2>Ocean County by the numbers</h2><p>Ocean County has about 646,434 residents and 295,201 housing units in the Census Bureau's 2019-2023 survey, number 5 by population among the 21 nj counties we cover. The median owner-occupied home is worth $366,600, 7% belo